<PageLayout title="Terms & Conditions" description="The terms for using the Zend website and joining the waitlist.">
  <p class="pg-updated">Last updated: 14 November 2026</p>

  <p>
    These terms explain the rules for using the Zend website and joining our waitlist. By using the site or joining the waitlist, you agree to them. We've written them in plain words; if anything is unclear, ask us at <a href="mailto:officialzendit@gmail.com">officialzendit@gmail.com</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>About Zend</h2>
  <p>
    Zend helps people buy and sell on social media without fear, starting with WhatsApp in Nigeria. When a buyer pays, Zend holds the money and only releases it to the seller after the buyer confirms they've received their order. Zend is a new company being set up in Nigeria and isn't registered yet; until it is, the Zend team runs it.
  </p>

  <h2>Zend isn't open yet</h2>
  <p>
    Zend is still being built. This website explains how it will work, and the waitlist lets you hear first when it's ready. Nothing on this site lets you send or receive money yet. How Zend works may change before launch, and we can't promise an exact launch date.
  </p>
  <p>When Zend launches, you'll be asked to agree to full terms for buying, selling, payments and disputes before you use it. Those terms will apply to your payments, not this page.</p>

  <h2>Joining the waitlist</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Joining is free, and it doesn't commit you to anything.</li>
    <li>Please use your own name and a phone number or email that belongs to you.</li>
    <li>You must be old enough, where you live, to buy and sell and to make agreements on your own (in Nigeria, that's 18).</li>
    <li>You can leave the waitlist any time by writing to <a href="mailto:officialzendit@gmail.com">officialzendit@gmail.com</a>.</li>
    <li>Being on the waitlist doesn't guarantee a place, a launch date or any particular feature.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> explains what we do with your waitlist details.</p>

  <h2>Using this website</h2>
  <p>Please don't:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>try to break, overload or get around the security of the site or the waitlist</li>
    <li>sign up other people without their permission, or flood the waitlist with fake entries</li>
    <li>copy our name, logo, pictures or words to pretend to be Zend</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We may remove waitlist entries that break these rules.</p>

  <h2>Our name and content</h2>
  <p>The Zend name, logo, illustrations and the words on this site belong to Zend. You're welcome to share links to our site, but please don't reuse our content without asking.</p>

  <h2>Fees</h2>
  <p>Zend is free for now. If that changes, we'll tell you clearly before you're ever charged.</p>

  <h2>Things we can't promise</h2>
